4 Types of issues:

a. Language Errors>> Missing braces, wrong indetation, Typo.  HCL (declrative configuration language approach).
b. State errors >> Drifts (Manually changes something managed by terraform), deleted or moved state.
c. Core errors >> Bugs in Terraform, Dependency graph issue. (issue in terrform inbuild code)
d. Provider errors >> invalid creds, API limits/Timeouts, Wrong arguments in the resource (autheication with the aws and azure then its provider task to make communication)

